# OSS/ROS packages that qirp-sdk transitively depends on (debian/control),
# confirmed by an actual DDM build attempt with qirp-sdk un-blacklisted:
# mmdebstrap pulled in exactly these packages as real, resolved dependencies,
# which is what check_ddm_blacklist() flagged before they were moved here.
#
# They're allowed into DDM images, but only as equivs-style build-time stub
# packages (see pack_deb.py's build_ddm_stub_packages()) so the DDM build
# stays slim and never fetches their real content from the OSS/ROS archives.
#
# After the device is flashed, install-ddm-packages.sh installs the real
# package for every name listed here, replacing the stub.
#
# One package name per line.
libvisual-0.4-0
libgstreamer1.0-0
